# =========================================================
# Simulator ESP32 — jalankan dengan ekstensi VS Code "REST Client"
# (humao.rest-client): klik "Send Request" di atas tiap request.
#
# Key demo dari database/seed.sql. Kalau sudah klik "Buat key baru" di
# halaman Perangkat, ganti @key dengan key yang baru.
# PERHATIAN: request POST/PATCH menulis data sungguhan ke database.
# =========================================================

@base = http://localhost:3000
@key = pf_demo_7c1e0a2f9b4d4e8a8f3c6b5a1d2e0f9c

### 1. Ambil jadwal aktif (alat memanggil ini saat boot)
GET {{base}}/api/device/schedules
X-Device-Key: {{key}}

### 2. Heartbeat + sensor (alat memanggil ini tiap ±1 menit)
POST {{base}}/api/device/readings
X-Device-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bowl_weight_g": 12.4, "hopper_level_pct": 63.5 }

### 3. Makanan baru jatuh → catat sesi makan (ambil "id" dari respon)
# @name feeding
POST {{base}}/api/device/feedings
X-Device-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "schedule_id": 1, "scheduled_at": "2026-10-20T07:00:00+07:00", "dispensed_g": 48.5 }

### 4. Pet selesai makan → kirim sisa, status severity dihitung
PATCH {{base}}/api/device/feedings/{{feeding.response.body.id}}
X-Device-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "leftover_g": 6.2 }

### 5. Uji: tanpa key → 401
GET {{base}}/api/device/schedules

### 6. Uji: sisa lebih besar dari yang jatuh → 400
PATCH {{base}}/api/device/feedings/{{feeding.response.body.id}}
X-Device-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "leftover_g": 999 }
